<title>PORTUGAL: Soporcel '96 net 0.2 bln esc vs 11.2 bln '95.</title>
<headline>Soporcel '96 net 0.2 bln esc vs 11.2 bln '95.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net	  0.2 vs 11.2</p>
<p>Turnover  61.5 vs 76.0</p>
<p>Cash flow 14.0 vs 25.8</p>
<p>Note - Soporcel said adverse conditions in the pulp and paper market weighed on its 1996 results compared with 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
